  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Parasitic Energy Manipulation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Darkstar_Levitation.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20180704231003\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Darkstar Levitation\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Darkstar_Levitation.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180704231003\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Darkstar_Levitation.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180704231003 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8f/Darkstar_Levitation.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20180704231003 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Darkstar Levitation\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Darkstar_Levitation.jpeg\" data-image-name=\"Darkstar Levitation.jpeg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Michael Morningstar/Darkstar (Ben 10 Series) drains the life out of helpless victims using parasitic energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Manipulate energy that behaves like a parasite.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>manipulate a parasitical force of energy.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Parasitic Force Manipulation\">Parasitic Force Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Symbiotic Energy Manipulation\">Symbiotic Energy Manipulation</a>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user has the power to harness an energy that not only inflicts damage but simultaneously absorbs other forms of energy such as fire or electricity to make itself more destructive. By generating this energy from the body, the user can apply the absorbed energy onto themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Vampirism\" title=\"Energy Vampirism\">Energy Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conversion_Manipulation\" title=\"Conversion Manipulation\">Conversion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Draining_Vision\" title=\"Draining Vision\">Draining Vision</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Energy Attacks\">Energy Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Beam_Emission\" title=\"Absorption Beam Emission\">Absorption Beam Emission</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Aura\" title=\"Elemental Aura\">Energy Aura</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Constructs\" title=\"Energy Constructs\">Energy Constructs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Parasitic Energy Generation\">Parasitic Energy Generation</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Propulsion\" title=\"Energy Propulsion\">Energy Propulsion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasite_Manipulation\" title=\"Parasite Manipulation\">Parasite Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Atomic_Cancellation\" title=\"Atomic Cancellation\">Atomic Cancellation</a> - by leeching particle energy binding atoms.</li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Control_Inducement\" title=\"Control Inducement\">Control Inducement</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Physiology\">Energy Physiology</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Ergokinetic_Combat\" title=\"Ergokinetic Combat\">Ergokinetic Combat</a></li>\n<li>Parasitic <a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Remote Energy Manipulation\">Remote Energy Manipulation</a> - by parasitically taking into energy signatures.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasite_Magic\" title=\"Parasite Magic\">Parasite Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Psi-Leech Energy Manipulation\">Psi-Leech Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Parasitic Force Manipulation\">Parasitic Force Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Anti-Energy Manipulation\">Anti-Energy Manipulation</a>&#160;destroys all forms of energy.</li>\n<li>May be unable to create energy, being limited to manipulating only from already existing sources.</li>\n<li>May be limited to amount of energy a person can hold in themselves.</li>\n<li>Extensive use of powers over a long period of time could deplete one's energy reserves.</li>\n<li>May be limited on amount energy or the type of energy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Starro (<i>Batman The Brave And The Bold</i>); augmented in reconstituted humanoid form</li>\n<li>Michael Morningstar/Darkstar (<i>Ben 10 Series</i>); in negative form</li>\n<li>Tayuya (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Pokémon that can use \"Absorb\", \"Mega Drain\" and \"Giga Drain\" (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Yveltal (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FParasitic_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0